                <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black text-white leading-[1.1] tracking-tight">
                    Toda la emoción de <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-400 via-yellow-300 to-amber-500 bg-clip-text text-transparent">Dreams Casino</span> en tus manos.
                </h1>

                <p class="text-slate-300 text-base sm:text-lg max-w-xl mx-auto lg:mx-0 leading-relaxed">
                    Descarga <strong>DreamsClub</strong> y accede a cartelera de shows exclusivos, ruleta con premios diarios, beneficios VIP en los 8 casinos y los mejores stickers de WhatsApp.
                </p>

                <!-- Action Buttons -->
                <div id="download" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center lg:justify-start gap-4 pt-4">
                    <a 
                        id="apkDownloadBtn"
                        href="https://github.com/shaklinedj/DreamsClub-Release/releases/download/v1.0.7/app-arm64-v8a-release.apk" 
