                        Gira la ruleta de la suerte cada 24 horas y desbloquea créditos, racha de visitas y recompensas.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-amber-500/40 transition-all group">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/20 text-amber-400 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                        🎪
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-white text-lg mb-2">Cartelera de Shows</h3>
